motion-solid
Author: David Di Biase. Distributed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

This project is a Solid 2.0 port of Motion for Vue (motion-v) and Framer Motion / Motion,
and includes code derived from them. Both are distributed under the MIT License.

motion-vue (motion-v)
  https://github.com/motiondivision/motion-vue
  The package layout, motion state machine (MotionState), features, gesture and
  layout integration, AnimatePresence exit sessions, Reorder and tests are adapted
  from motion-vue.

framer-motion / Motion
  https://github.com/motiondivision/motion
  The public API, component semantics and the animation engine (framer-motion,
  motion-dom, motion-utils, used as dependencies) come from Motion.

